msgstr "No se ha podido crear la página."

#: includes/admin/pagina.php:150
msgid ""
"The page has been created and selected as your terms and conditions page."
msgstr "La página se ha creado y seleccionado como tu página de condiciones."

#: includes/admin/pagina.php:152
msgid "Edit it"
msgstr "Editarla"

#: includes/admin/pagina.php:154
msgid "See it"
msgstr "Verla"

#: includes/admin/pagina.php:208
msgid "The legal guarantee notice is not being shown anywhere."
msgstr "El aviso de garantía legal no se está mostrando en ninguna parte."

#: includes/admin/pagina.php:209
msgid ""
"Article 22a requires it to be displayed at shop level. Turn on the floating "
"button, the menu or the footer, or place it yourself with the shortcode."
msgstr ""
"El artículo 22 bis obliga a mostrarlo a nivel de tienda. Activa el botón "
"flotante, el menú o el pie, o colócalo tú con el shortcode."

#: includes/admin/pagina.php:213 includes/clases/salud.php:58
