#, php-format
msgid "EU legal guarantee notice not shown at the checkout: %s."
msgstr ""
"Aviso de la garantía legal de la UE no mostrado en Finalizar compra: %s."

#. translators: 1: product name. 2: the guarantee in one line, e.g. "5 years
#. from Acme, EU GARAN label".
